{"text": "Cuando intentaron volver a la mesa, vieron al gato de la casa junto a una silla. Los primos regresaron a su escondite sin acercarse. El ratón de campo comprendió que disfrutar de aquella comida también traía preocupaciones. Ratón de campo: Prefiero no arriesgarme para cenar.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.404458, "from": 0, "to": 6}, {"start": 0.419208, "end": 1.083791, "from": 7, "to": 17}, {"start": 1.098541, "end": 1.526832, "from": 18, "to": 24}, {"start": 1.541625, "end": 1.5859159, "from": 25, "to": 26}, {"start": 1.600666, "end": 1.704041, "from": 27, "to": 29}, {"start": 1.718833, "end": 2.132333, "from": 30, "to": 34}, {"start": 2.531083, "end": 2.870749, "from": 36, "to": 42}, {"start": 2.885541, "end": 3.018457, "from": 43, "to": 45}, {"start": 3.033208, "end": 3.372874, "from": 46, "to": 50}, {"start": 3.387666, "end": 3.505832, "from": 51, "to": 53}, {"start": 3.520583, "end": 3.638749, "from": 54, "to": 56}, {"start": 3.6535, "end": 4.022708, "from": 57, "to": 61}, {"start": 4.037458, "end": 4.377124, "from": 62, "to": 67}, {"start": 4.391916, "end": 4.421457, "from": 68, "to": 69}, {"start": 4.436208, "end": 4.716791, "from": 70, "to": 73}, {"start": 4.731583, "end": 5.248458, "from": 74, "to": 79}, {"start": 6.276583, "end": 6.527666, "from": 81, "to": 84}, {"start": 6.542416, "end": 6.955916, "from": 85, "to": 91}, {"start": 6.970708, "end": 7.679583, "from": 92, "to": 102}, {"start": 7.694333, "end": 7.7386239, "from": 103, "to": 104}, {"start": 7.753416, "end": 7.886332, "from": 105, "to": 107}, {"start": 7.901125, "end": 8.565708, "from": 108, "to": 117}, {"start": 8.580458, "end": 8.831541, "from": 118, "to": 121}, {"start": 8.846291, "end": 9.673332, "from": 122, "to": 131}, {"start": 10.692333, "end": 10.913874, "from": 133, "to": 135}, {"start": 10.928625, "end": 11.297833, "from": 136, "to": 141}, {"start": 11.312625, "end": 11.416, "from": 142, "to": 144}, {"start": 11.43075, "end": 11.8295, "from": 145, "to": 150}, {"st